    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken to find yourself in a bizarre village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An obsessive suitor is pursuing you, desperate to claim a kiss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622290/extras/bcb881f75114dd2253108da89fe536ca.avif?t=1750140139\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must determine if every hut in the village is completely identical to the first one in order to obtain the key to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622290/extras/deb86f4cac7c2a75d2f6ae86ec30ea80.avif?t=1750140139\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only one chance awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was entirely self-taught and independently developed by the creator. If you encounter bugs or have feedback, feel free to contact the developer for troubleshooting or a refund.<br>Thank you for your support!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken to find yourself in a bizarre village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An obsessive suitor is pursuing you, desperate to claim a kiss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622290/extras/bcb881f75114dd2253108da89fe536ca.avif?t=1750140139\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must determine if every hut in the village is completely identical to the first one in order to obtain the key to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622290/extras/deb86f4cac7c2a75d2f6ae86ec30ea80.avif?t=1750140139\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only one chance awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was entirely self-taught and independently developed by the creator. If you encounter bugs or have feedback, feel free to contact the developer for troubleshooting or a refund.<br>Thank you for your support!</p>",
